     Python MessagePack CVE as a false positive. Two landed in the first two
     days of the gate, which showed per-CVE suppression to be a treadmill;
     the jar itself is now excluded in deps.edn (the API negotiates only
     JSON and EDN, so nothing could reach it), and a suppression for an
     absent jar is clutter. The file and its wiring stay, so the next real
     false positive costs one entry here rather than plumbing. -->
